              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લૂ — lū — \"a hot summer wind\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મે મહિનામાં બપોરે ગરમ લૂ ફૂંકાય છે. me mahināmā̃ bapore garam lū phū̃kāy che. In May a hot wind blows in the afternoon."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લૂ (lū) CDIAL lists Hindi lūhar and Sindhi lūha, \"the hot summer wind\", under lūṣā, \"burning\", a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 11099); it gives no Gujarati form, so the link is hedged."
            }
          ]
        },
